  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Given NNN space separated integers, please perform the following operations\n\n\nFind the smallest element of the array and store it as the variable smallsmallsmall\nFind the largest element of the array and store it as the variable largelargelarge\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input will contain a single integer TTT, denoting the number of test cases.\nEach test case consists of a two lines of input\n\n1st1^{st}1st line contains the integer NNN\n2nd2^{nd}2nd line contains NNN space separated integers - denoting the array AAA\n\n\n\n\nOutput Format\n\nFor each test case, output on a single line the 2 integers smallsmallsmall and largelargelarge",
